      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1437998033,
      "version": 3989,
      "versionNonce": 926487974,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778622766638,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. create the following variables: minPrice and maxProfit\n2. set maxProfit to zero and minPrice to prices[0]\n3. for each price in prices\n    4. if price is less than min\n        5. update minPrice\n    6. calculate profit equal to price - minPrice\n    7 if profit is greater than maxProfit\n        8. update maxProfit\n    9. go to the line 3\n10. return maxProfit",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. create the following variables: minPrice and maxProfit\n2. set maxProfit to zero and minPrice to prices[0]\n3. for each price in prices\n    4. if price is less than min\n        5. update minPrice\n    6. calculate profit equal to price - minPrice\n    7 if profit is greater than maxProfit\n        8. update maxProfit\n    9. go to the line 3\n10. return maxProfit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
